----------
To find the default path, try the following.
It will return the path in the form:  LOC::A:\

PROC getpath$:
        LOCAL pp$(129)
        CALL($0387,UADD(ADDR(pp$),1),0,0,0)
        POKEB ADDR(pp$),8
        RETURN pp$
ENDP

Roger


